# Hand-made backups. `*~` and `*.swp` covered the editor's own, but not the ones people make by
# renaming — a renamed copy of the retired Bill shell once sat untracked-but-not-ignored, because
# gitignore does no suffix matching.
*.old
*.bak
*.orig

# Local secrets / sandbox credentials — never commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

